From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 10:30:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: apple: jpeg: test the T8132 revision under the
 T6041 match

The T8132 engines carry "apple,t6041-jpeg" as their fallback, so they
are admitted by the T6041 variant. Their ADT hw-type is 0x100008: the
T6041 revision 0x101008 with stepping nibble 0 instead of 1. Pin that
in the identity test: 0x100008 and its other steppings pass the T6041
match, a different low byte or the T8140 revision does not.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
(cherry picked from commit d6f59a2eb51a6819a8941976816d3f6419f38093)
(cherry picked from commit 0f06dbf8095c048b0362466751982b7abcb3697c)
---
 drivers/media/platform/apple/jpeg/apple-jpeg-test.c | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/apple/jpeg/apple-jpeg-test.c b/drivers/media/platform/apple/jpeg/apple-jpeg-test.c
index 8e9b61e684..eee013dde3 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/apple/jpeg/apple-jpeg-test.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/apple/jpeg/apple-jpeg-test.c
@@ -19,6 +19,11 @@ static void apple_jpeg_hwrev_test(struct kunit *test)
 	KUNIT_EXPECT_TRUE(test, apple_jpeg_hwrev_supported(&apple_jpeg_t6041, 0x10f008));
 	KUNIT_EXPECT_FALSE(test, apple_jpeg_hwrev_supported(&apple_jpeg_t6041, 0x101009));
 	KUNIT_EXPECT_FALSE(test, apple_jpeg_hwrev_supported(&apple_jpeg_t8140, 0x101008));
+	/* T8132 (ADT hw-type 0x100008) matches through its T6041 fallback. */
+	KUNIT_EXPECT_TRUE(test, apple_jpeg_hwrev_supported(&apple_jpeg_t6041, 0x100008));
+	KUNIT_EXPECT_TRUE(test, apple_jpeg_hwrev_supported(&apple_jpeg_t6041, 0x102008));
+	KUNIT_EXPECT_FALSE(test, apple_jpeg_hwrev_supported(&apple_jpeg_t6041, 0x100009));
+	KUNIT_EXPECT_FALSE(test, apple_jpeg_hwrev_supported(&apple_jpeg_t8140, 0x100008));
 	KUNIT_EXPECT_FALSE(test, apple_jpeg_hwrev_supported(NULL, 0x110000));
 }
 
